              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Scraping and Metric Types",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Prometheus ==pulls== (scrapes) `/metrics` over HTTP on a schedule",
                "Stores {blue:time series} with **labels**",
                "`up` is 1 when a target scrapes fine"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Type",
                "Behaviour",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Counter",
                  "only increases",
                  "`rate()`"
                ],
                [
                  "Gauge",
                  "up and down",
                  "read directly"
                ],
                [
                  "Histogram",
                  "buckets",
                  "`histogram_quantile`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Discovery and PromQL",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Kubernetes ==service discovery== finds targets",
                "Operator: `ServiceMonitor` / `PodMonitor` CRDs",
                "{orange:Alertmanager} sends alerts, {green:Grafana} draws dashboards",
                "Prometheus = trends; metrics-server = `kubectl top` and HPA"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "promql",
              "lines": [
                "rate(http_requests_total[5m])",
                "sum by (pod)(rate(http_requests_total[5m]))"
              ],
              "note": "per-second rate, then summed per pod"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Cheat Sheet",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Topic",
